ore_item_assets/steam/apps/2207610/extras/767c4bdfec72b4d62c54f39daff511ba.poster.avif?t=1769701789\" width=1170 height=760 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207610/extras/767c4bdfec72b4d62c54f39daff511ba.webm?t=1769701789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207610/extras/767c4bdfec72b4d62c54f39daff511ba.mp4?t=1769701789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each phase feeds into the next, forming a strategic loop of decisions, trade-offs, and consequences that defines the fate of the territory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Consequences: Shape the land</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Short-term gains can lead to long-term damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Resource production can stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Damaged areas must be restored before further actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control <strong>CO\u2082 levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent irreversible damage to the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt before climate pressure overwhelms the system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The territory remembers every decision \u2014 for better or worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success in <i>Beat the Heat</i> is defined by your ability to maintain balance over time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep <strong>CO\u2082 generation below critical thresholds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent excessive destruction of map areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the end of the time limit with a functional, resilient ecosystem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no perfect solutions, only <strong>informed decisions and their consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Blazing Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2207610/header.jpg?t=1769701789","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2207610/518189/c7f625964d0998cac2ae12da8dbf9f7af425706d/1751090173/dash_av1.mpd?t=1669847594","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2207610/518189/c7f625964d0998cac2ae12da8dbf9f7af425706d/1751090173/dash_h264.mpd?t=1669847594","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2207610/518189/c7f625964d0998cac2ae12da8dbf9f7af425706d/1751090173/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1669847594","id":256918719,"name":"FirstTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256918719/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1669847594"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2207610/148299036/dd0a18fe45dee00df72d763349ca99f4ff236fa3/1766585043/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766588371","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2207610/148299036/dd0a18fe45dee00df72d763349ca99f4ff236fa3/1766585043/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766588371","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2207610/148299036/dd0a18fe45dee00df72d